    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f9855f97_e3b25e4f",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 10,
      "author": {
        "id": 3332404
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-27T12:09:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have already considered the ioprio cgroup policy, but it still does not meet our needs. We have the following unresolved issues:\n1. For requests of type IOPRIO_CLASS_RT, the `ufshcd_comp_scsi_upiu` function adds the UPIU_CMD_FLAGS_CP flag to the `upiu_flags`, causing UFS to prioritize these types of I/O. However, marking high-priority I/O at the thread granularity can lead to an excessive number of high-priority I/O, which may cause the UFS priority marking to become ineffective.\n2. We want to statistic the distribution of high-priority I/O at different granularities and types in order to set I/O priorities more rationally. We aim to avoid marking too many large-granularity I/O as high-priority I/O, which could result in significant delays for important small-granularity I/O, especially on low-end devices.",
      "parentUuid": "4ebea616_a3a1ee7f",
      "revId": "1062c02cb2b5b4ebbfaddff39afcef6879530181",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4b4e243c_8d51e987",
        "filename": "/COMMIT_MSG",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 10,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869780
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-27T16:42:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case this wouldn\u0027t be clear, `IOPRIO_CLASS_RT` is assigned by the ioprio cgroup policy.\n\nPlease consider implementing the necessary algorithms in the ioprio cgroup policy and configuring the parameters for these algorithms via `task_profiles.json`, either the generic configuration file or the vendor-specific `task_profiles.json` file.\n\nOr alternatively, disable assigning `IOPRIO_CLASS_RT` by overriding this `task_profiles.json` section:\n```\n        {\n          \"Name\": \"SetAttribute\",\n          \"Params\":\n          {\n            \"Name\": \"IoPrioClass\",\n            \"Value\": \"promote-to-rt\",\n            \"Optional\": \"true\"\n          }\n        }\n```",
      "parentUuid": "f9855f97_e3b25e4f",
      "revId": "1062c02cb2b5b4ebbfaddff39afcef6879530181",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    }
